<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">In the evaluation phase, we employ the “Large Language Model as a Judge” (LLM-as-a-Judge) paradigm to determine whether the agent exhibits behavioral misalignment resulting from the introduction of external experience. The prompt designed to guide this judgment is as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 62" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 56.1 C 0 59.36 2.64 62 5.91 62 L 471.47 62 C 474.73 62 477.38 59.36 477.38 56.1 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 37.89 L 475.41 37.89 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 46.49)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.28em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="377.48"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.28em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">LLM Judge Prompt for AgentNet Experiment</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="434.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.Px1.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
