<span id="A3.T11.2.5.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T11.2.5.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">Given the screenshot as below. What’s the next step that you will do to help with the task?</span></span>
