<span id="A3.T13.2.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T13.2.4.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">I have a tar file named myfile.tar. Could you please help me to extract its contents to a specific folder on my computer?</span></span>
